        "content": "## DATA ENTRY AND VELIDATION  \n                                                            \n **FORM TRIGGER** \n- It is used to enter patient data for making insurance claim.\n- It includes patient name, doctor name, insurance id etc.\n\n**DATA VALIDATION**\n- This node insures that all data is present no data is missing.\n\n   **GOOGLE SHEETS**\n-  This node is used to store all patient data in our google sheets",
